  "item_short_desc": "<p>As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the Midnight Camo Special Ops Soft Shell Jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell Waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The high-performance fabric will help protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. This versatile camouflage jacket is perfect for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133397",
  "description": "<p>As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the Midnight Camo Special Ops Soft Shell Jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell Waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The high-performance fabric will help protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. This versatile camouflage jacket is perfect for militatry personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts. Ultimate Stealth Ops Camo: Inspired by stealth operations that require zero visibility to the opposition, Rothco has reinvented the classic Woodland Camouflage Pattern as well as our bestselling Black Camouflage Pattern to bring you the Midnight Camo Collection. The subdued color combinations offer a true stealth, sharp and sleek appearance whether on mission or off. Comfortable Fleece Lining: The insulated jacket features a soft fleece lining that keeps you warm, ideal for cold weather tactical operations and outdoor adventures. The fleece-lined collar features a removable stowaway hood and provides additional protection. High-Capacity Storage: The military soft shell jacket comes equipped with 8 tactical zipper pockets: 2 shoulder pockets, 2 chest pockets, 2 internal pockets, 1 back pocket, and 1 arm pocket for storing tactical gear and outdoor essentials. Utility at the Forefront: The tactical jacket features underarm ventilation zippers that ensure optimal comfort by allowing air circulation. The drawstring waist and adjustable elastic wrist cuffs provide a perfect fit, while the two-way zipper offers quick and easy access. The 2 shoulder loop fields are great for displaying your morale and flag patches.</p>",
